<title>USA: ST PAUL HOGS $0.50/1.00 HIGHER - USDA.</title>
<headline>ST PAUL HOGS $0.50/1.00 HIGHER - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST PAUL 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $0.50-1.00 higher. Top $56.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3     220-250 lbs   55.50-56.00</p>
<p>US 1-3     250-260 lbs   55.00-56.00</p>
<p>Sows: Steady. Top 49.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3     300-500 lbs   45.00-46.00</p>
<p>	     500-550 lbs   46.00-46.50</p>
<p>	     550-700 lbs   48.50-49.00</p>
